    "purpose": "Cooking-specific modifiers consumed by xpEngine.js and planner.js. Each key is the exact skill name as it appears in farm.skills from the live farm state. All values verified against skills.json. For the complete skill catalogue covering all skill groups (Crops, Trees, Mining, Fishing, Animals, etc.) see skills.json.",
